{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder with concatenation fusion, comparing against config_016 (pca_n2000 RNA encoder). Validation accuracy of 0.5362 (vs. 0.5266 for config_016) and F1 of 0.5158 suggest the RNA encoder choice may contribute to multimodal performance. Uncertainty remains about the relative impact of RNA encoder quality versus image data integration, as no direct comparisons with alternative single-modality configurations were made."
}

